# Cursor worktree + CodeGraph

- SessionStart creates `~/.cursor/worktrees/Deneb/<session-id>` on `cursor/<session-id>`.
- Scope **all** Shell (`working_directory`) and Write/StrReplace/Delete paths to that worktree.
- Do **not** call `move_agent_to_root` into a git worktree — it can force the worktree onto `main`.
- Main checkout (`~/deneb` or any main-branch primary checkout) edits are blocked by `cursor-worktree-guard`.
- Structure/relation/blast-radius questions: use MCP **codegraph_explore** (or CLI `codegraph callers|impact|node`) before multi-file grep/Read.
- String-keyed RPC/tool/event names: `scripts/dev/rpcmap.py <name>` then `codegraph node <handler>`.
